  "name": "Chicken Dopiaza",
  "subtitle": "Slow-cooked chicken with onions and whole spices",
  "description": "Bone-in chicken is cooked with yogurt, onions, aromatic spices, herbs, and lime for a richly seasoned Indian curry.",
